---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Finora"
  description="Finora Privacy Policy. Learn how we handle your data, sessions, and research queries."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-3 uppercase">// legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest text-ink-3 uppercase">Last updated: August 28, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This Privacy Policy explains how Finora Labs collects, uses, and protects information
          when you use the Finora financial research platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-ink">Account Information</h3>
            <p class="mt-1">Email, name, and hashed password. We do not store plaintext passwords.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-ink">Session Data</h3>
            <p class="mt-1">Session tokens stored in your browser, expiring after inactivity.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-ink">Research Queries</h3>
            <p class="mt-1">Company name, time period, objective, and resulting research data.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-ink">Usage Counters</h3>
            <p class="mt-1">Research run counts and daily chat message limits per user.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Data is processed through:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-annotate-green mt-1">&#10003;</span> <strong class="text-ink">SEC EDGAR</strong> — Public financial filing data</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-annotate-green mt-1">&#10003;</span> <strong class="text-ink">NVIDIA API</strong> — AI language model processing</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-annotate-green mt-1">&#10003;</span> <strong class="text-ink">Twelve Data</strong> — Stock market price data</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-annotate-green mt-1">&#10003;</span> <strong class="text-ink">Tavily</strong> — Web search for source discovery</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-annotate-green mt-1">&#10003;</span> <strong class="text-ink">Jina</strong> — Web page content extraction</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">4. Cookies &amp; Storage</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Finora uses local storage for authentication and theme preferences only. No tracking cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">5. Data Security</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We implement HTTPS encryption, hashed passwords, and input validation. No method is 100% secure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">6. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Questions? Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@finora.dev" class="font-semibold text-annotate-blue hover:underline">hello@finora.dev</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
